els consistently from upper left. Avoid floating products.\n\nVisual treatment: high-end real product still-life photography, believable glass refraction, satin packaging, precise pump construction, microscopic water droplets, gently diffused daylight, subtle grounded shadows, low contrast; white dominates, pale icy blue only as a light accent, restrained olive-green packaging from the reference. No deep blue. Beautiful but quiet. Optimized to remain legible in a mobile long-image display.\n\nSTRICT exclusions: absolutely NO words, NO numbers, NO brand names, NO logos, NO labels, NO medical symbols, NO claims, NO icons, NO frame, NO UI, NO divider lines, NO collage borders, NO people, NO hands, NO extra ingredients or botanical props. This is an invented unbranded series concept photograph, not evidence about any real product.",
